stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: File retention and Trash lifecycle
  accDescr: Active files move to Trash after dependency review. Trash retains quota for thirty days and can restore eligible files. Permanent deletion is separately confirmed. Trash does not revoke published URLs.
  [*] --> Active: Confirmed upload
  Active --> Trash: Dependency review and confirmation
  Trash --> Active: Restore before expiry
  Trash --> Purge: Thirty-day retention expires
  Trash --> Purge: Separately confirm permanent deletion
  Purge --> ObjectCleanup: Remove stored object
  ObjectCleanup --> CleanupRetry: Cleanup failed
  CleanupRetry --> ObjectCleanup: Retry cleanup
  ObjectCleanup --> Removed: Confirmed cleanup
  note right of Trash: Quota retained. Published URLs are not revoked by Trash.
